From 099fb38358a4239688ee67f36067028eee45af68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 07:34:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: F-215 - wxl-heirloom-slots as a v1.1 extension

Same armour-getter detour (0x0061A6B0, chest * n/16 per slot bit) as the
pre-1.1 module, now a standalone Extensions/wxl-heirloom-slots DLL that
attaches through WXL_Api::HookAttach in WXL_Load. Other extensions/ dirs
are their own forge repos and stay ignored.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UyueuvSmK9GmAwFmmoVjp9
